# The Hermes browser build only COPYs these two trees.  Keeping the context
# allowlisted avoids shipping local node_modules, generated bundles, and the
# other frontend experiments to Docker on every Hermes UI build.
*
!hermes-desktop-ui/
!hermes-desktop-ui/**
!hermes-shared/
!hermes-shared/**

# The allowlisted app still has local development output beneath it.  The
# Dockerfile installs its own dependencies and creates its own dist bundle.
hermes-desktop-ui/node_modules/
hermes-desktop-ui/dist/
hermes-desktop-ui/release/
hermes-desktop-ui/.vite/
hermes-desktop-ui/.eslintcache
